<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This project focuses on enhancing quality management practices and software development standards at Saudi Arabian Airlines \(Saudia\), specifically addressing the issue of frequent flight delays. As a leading airline, Saudia is committed to operational efficiency and superior customer experiences. The primary objective is to assess and improve Saudia's project management software systems to align them with international quality standards like ISO and IATA.)
/E (This project focuses on enhancing quality management practices and software development standards at Saudi Arabian Airlines \(Saudia\), specifically addressing the issue of frequent flight delays. As a leading airline, Saudia is committed to operational efficiency and superior customer experiences. The primary objective is to assess and improve Saudia's project management software systems to align them with international quality standards like ISO and IATA.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Through methodologies such as Fishbone Analysis, the project identifies root causes of delays and develops actionable strategies for improvement. By implementing a comprehensive quality framework, this initiative aims to streamline processes, foster a culture of continuous improvement, and elevate service delivery. Ultimately, our goal is to position Saudia as a high-performing airline that meets the demands of a dynamic aviation market while supporting the Kingdom's Vision 2030 objectives.)
/E (Through methodologies such as Fishbone Analysis, the project identifies root causes of delays and develops actionable strategies for improvement. By implementing a comprehensive quality framework, this initiative aims to streamline processes, foster a culture of continuous improvement, and elevate service delivery. Ultimately, our goal is to position Saudia as a high-performing airline that meets the demands of a dynamic aviation market while supporting the Kingdom's Vision 2030 objectives.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
